# Secrets — nx-cloud.env holds NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN and is read from the
# workspace root by nx and nx-mcp. The pre-commit secret scanner has no
# pattern for Nx Cloud tokens (they are opaque), so exclusion is the control.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
nx-cloud.env
